          ],
          "bullets": [
            "Speaking in Canberra on 24 November, hours after the Entity List filing, Prime Minister Lawrence Wong said: \"America has export controls on its chips. We do not enforce America's export controls, but we do not want Singapore to be used and abused as a conduit by companies to circumvent America's export controls.\" He said Singapore is \"working very closely with the US administration\" to \"work out a mechanism where America can do its own enforcement\".",
