            "Meta said Muse is now available to anyone aged 18 or over in the UK, on iOS, Android, muse.ai and WhatsApp, free for most uses with optional subscription plans. It had launched in the US on 8 September. UK launch partners named include Marks & Spencer, ASOS, Currys, easyJet and Jet2, alongside Spotify and OpenTable; checkout runs through Link by Stripe, which uses a separate digital card for agents, or Shop Pay.",
