            "Prosecutors laid out recordings spanning 15 folders dated September 8 to 28, covering meetings on 12 days in an executive conference room, including one file titled \"1200-sovereign-bilateral-briefing-sep22\". They said he photographed a confidential term sheet for a \"strategic partnership\" early on October 5, the same day a hidden camera recorded him checking behind the television where OpenAI's security team had found the planted device.",
