          "headline": "Senator Reed asks Bessent and Lutnick to testify on Huang's reinstatement; Huang due before Senate Banking on December 3",
          "sources": [
            { "name": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/nvidia-jensen-huang-politics-market.html" },
            { "name": "TechCrunch", "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/jensen-huang-scheduled-to-testify-next-week-in-senate-following-reinstatement-as-nvidia-ceo/" }
